Whisper: build browser/components/whisper

What: adds Whisper's own directory to the build.
Why: everything Whisper adds to the browser lives in new files in that directory
(default prefs, the Cast stylesheets and Inter font, the tab sidebar modes, the
bundled uBlock Origin). Whisper.manifest there hooks it into Firefox's window lifecycle
categories, so no Firefox file needs to change to load it; this line is the only entry.
---
diff --git a/browser/components/moz.build b/browser/components/moz.build
index 9a95522578..85309642e6 100644
--- a/browser/components/moz.build
+++ b/browser/components/moz.build
@@ -81,6 +81,9 @@ DIRS += [
     "webrtc",
 ]
 
+# Whisper's own interface, prefs and bundled uBlock Origin (all new files).
+DIRS += ["whisper"]
+
 DIRS += ["build"]
 
 if CONFIG["MOZ_SELECTABLE_PROFILES"]:
